{'symbol': 'CNC', 'date': '2023-03-29 18:00:00', 'title': 'HEALTH NET PROVIDING SPECIAL ASSISTANCE TO MEMBERS AFFECTED BY WINTER STORMS', 'text': 'HEALTH NET ASSISTING MEMBERS IN ALAMEDA, MARIN, MODOC AND SHASTA COUNTIES DURING STATE OF EMERGENCY SACRAMENTO, CALIF. , MARCH 29, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0IN RESPONSE TO GOV.'}{'symbol': 'CNC', 'date': '2023-03-29 16:10:00', 'title': 'EVOLENT HEALTH AND CENTENE AGREE TO EXPANDED PARTNERSHIP FOR ONCOLOGY SPECIALTY CARE FOR MEDICARE ADVANTAGE MEMBERS', 'text': "WASHINGTON , MARCH 29, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- EVOLENT HEALTH, INC. (NYSE: EVH), A HEALTH CARE COMPANY THAT DELIVERS PROVEN VALUE-BASED SPECIALTY CARE SOLUTIONS TO PAYERS AND PROVIDERS, TODAY ANNOUNCED AN AGREEMENT TO EXPAND ITS TECHNOLOGY AND SERVICES SOLUTION FOR ONCOLOGY WITH ITS EXISTING PARTNER, CENTENE CORPORATION, (NYSE: CNC).\xa0 CENTENE WILL EXPAND ITS USE OF EVOLENT HEALTH'S ONCOLOGY SOLUTION ACROSS ITS CENTENE AND WELLCARE MEDICARE ADVANTAGE (MA) MEMBERS NATIONALLY."}